# The two-node run's inputs, pinned by SHA-256 and checked after every
# download and every cache restore (scripts/e2e.sh), so a cache entry can
# never stand in for a different file. Read by scripts/e2e.sh (CI's e2e
# workflow and scripts/check.sh) as shell assignments: values only, no code.
#
# mesh-llm v0.79.0, the unmodified release: Linux x86_64 (CPU build, CI's
# runner) and macOS arm64 (a local run).
